Protocol: DoubleRatchetBounded2x2

State:
  RK <- new
  CK <- new

Knowledge:
A : A,B,RK,CK,g,kdf_RKr,kdf_RKl,kdfl,kdfr,h
B : A,B,RK,CK,g,kdf_RKr,kdf_RKl,kdfl,kdfr,h

Actions:

# DH 1(A sends)


Repeat 2:
A: new X
A -> B : A,B,exp(g,X)
B: new Y
B -> A : A,B,exp(g,Y)




Let:
  DH = exp(exp(g, X), Y)
  CK1 = kdf_RKr(RK,DH)
  RK1 = kdf_RKl(RK,DH)

New State:
  CK = CK1
  RK = RK1

Repeat 2:

A -> B : {| format(MsgA1)|}_kdfr(CK)
B -> A : {| ack(h(MsgA1))|}_kdfr(CK)
Let:
    CKnext = kdfl(CK)
New State:
  CK = CKnext


EndRepeat
EndRepeat



Goals:
MsgA1 secret between A,B;
MsgA2 secret between A,B;


B weakly authenticates A on MsgA1;
B weakly authenticates A on MsgA2;

